{
  "_comment": "MERGE into .claude/settings.json (append to any existing SubagentStop / PreToolUse arrays; never overwrite the file). These wire the orchestrator into a LIVE Claude Code session, where subagents are dispatched through the Agent tool and none of the headless guards run. SubagentStart: injects the agent's playbook digest into its context. PreToolUse(Agent|Task): logs every dispatch and flags or refuses an upward model override. PreToolUse(Write|Edit|...): inside a subagent, refuses writes to protected files and outside its ownership. SubagentStop: records per-agent token usage and sends the agent back once if its report lacks the playbook's CHECKS / UNVERIFIED block. Policies (modelPolicy, reportPolicy, ownershipPolicy, protectedPolicy, tamperPolicy) are set in roster.json; every internal error fails open. The commands use the args form with ${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}, which Claude Code expands on every OS (a plain \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\" inside one command string was NOT expanded in a live run, so no hook fired at all). Needs node on PATH. A Bash-mediated write is not seen by the Write/Edit hook, so this is a guard against mistakes and drift, not a sandbox. Delete this _comment.",
  "hooks": {
    "SubagentStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node",
            "args": [
              "${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.agent-team/orchestrator.mjs",
              "hook",
              "SubagentStart"
            ],
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Agent|Task",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node",
            "args": [
              "${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.agent-team/orchestrator.mjs",
              "hook",
              "PreToolUse"
            ],
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit|MultiEdit|NotebookEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node",
            "args": [
              "${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.agent-team/orchestrator.mjs",
              "hook",
              "PreToolUse"
            ],
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node",
            "args": [
              "${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.agent-team/orchestrator.mjs",
              "hook",
              "SubagentStop"
            ],
            "timeout": 30
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
